#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:1
msgid "Magnolia Talent Plan, Pujiang Project 2026"
msgstr "2026白玉兰人才计划浦江项目"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:4
msgid "Grant | Citywide / global"
msgstr "补助｜全市／全球"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:6
msgid "2026 call published; not confirmed open"
msgstr "2026通知已公布，未确认正在受理"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S102 "
"<https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/zwgk/kyjhxm/xmsb/20260704/d150177f83ef4fc7bd6d6276905939d3.html>`_. "
"关于发布2026年度上海市白玉兰人才计划浦江项目申请指南的通知_项目申报_上海市科学技术委员会."
msgstr "`证据 S102 <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/zwgk/kyjhxm/xmsb/20260704/d150177f83ef4fc7bd6d6276905939d3.html>`_. 关于发布2026年度上海市白玉兰人才计划浦江项目申请指南的通知_项目申报_上海市科学技术委员会."

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:13
msgid "Category-specific support; consult the actual 2026 category"
msgstr "资助额按2026年具体类别确定"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:20
msgid ""
"The July 2026 guide supports eligible overseas returnees through distinct "
"categories. Scientific research and entrepreneurial routes must not be "
"confused; host endorsement may be required."
msgstr "2026年7月指南分类支持符合条件的留学人员，科研与创业类别不同，可能需要依托单位推荐。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:22
msgid "Confirm category deadline and host review"
msgstr "确认类别截止日期及依托单位审核"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:27
msgid "`Official application / policy route <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://stcsm.sh.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/pujiang.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
